---
title: "initialize (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate --> q_revert_invalid: params invalid
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_check_timing --> q_check_prefund: validate prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime
    q_check_prefund --> q_check_sale: prefundEndTime < startTime
    q_check_sale --> q_check_refund: startTime < endTime
    q_check_refund --> q_set_config: endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing violation
    q_check_prefund --> q_revert_timing: timing violation
    q_check_sale --> q_revert_timing: timing violation
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_timing: timing violation
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTiming
    q_set_config --> q_set_addresses: set tokenPrice, minimumInvestAmount, timing params
    q_set_addresses --> q_set_fees: set bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry
    q_set_fees --> [*]: set legionFee, referrerFee bps values

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime < startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-002: tokenPrice > 0
        INV-003: minimumInvestAmount > 0
        INV-004: bidToken and askToken are non-zero addresses
    end note
